WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.400
Number two, make good choices.

00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:03.400
Follow our super handy decision making guide.

00:00:03.400 --> 00:00:05.400
This will help you with any decision,

00:00:05.400 --> 00:00:08.400
but will also help you make the best career choice for you.

00:00:08.400 --> 00:00:11.400
Start by defining the decision you have to make.

00:00:11.400 --> 00:00:15.400
In this case, what career to plan for, then establish your criteria.

00:00:15.400 --> 00:00:18.400
That's what's important to you in a job.

00:00:18.400 --> 00:00:21.400
Next, identify the options of most interest to you,

00:00:21.400 --> 00:00:25.400
and then evaluate those options based on your criteria.

00:00:25.400 --> 00:00:27.400
Finally, make a decision.

00:00:27.400 --> 00:00:29.400
You can always reassess and change course as you go.

00:00:29.400 --> 00:00:33.400
But following these steps will help put your priorities in focus

00:00:33.400 --> 00:00:35.400
and make the best decision you can.

00:00:35.400 --> 00:00:36.000
Career tip number three, get out and volunteer.
